Subject: kit: the vendored tree passes the repository's type-aware lint

What: `default-themes.ts` is deleted; the build-oc2 script reads oc-2.json
through `parseDesktopTheme`; non-null and template assertions the checker
already proves are dropped; `List`'s `applyFilter` and `LineCommentV2`'s
`currentMention` return consistently; `MenuV2` calls a function `ref`
without re-asserting its type.
Why: patch 0003 dropped its re-export from `theme/index.ts` and nothing in
the repository imports it, so its 37 `as DesktopTheme` casts were dead reads
of theme JSON that skipped the parser. The rest are the
findings root `oxlint` reports in this package; behaviour is unchanged.

